# Stage C: catalogue build by tenure-type group (${vault_tag})

You are one catalogue agent. Your prompt names your **group** (C1 to C6), its tenure types and its
arrangement-id range. You extract every arrangement the vault evidences for your group's types in
${area}, under the rules of the water-tenure-analysis skill.

- Skill folder: `${analysis_skill}`
- Vault CLI: `${hpr}` (on Windows prefix commands with `PYTHONIOENCODING=utf-8`)
- Partial outputs: `research/runs/${vault_tag}/temp/catalogue/`
- Final catalogue (the orchestrator merges): `${catalogue_dir}`

